# Your final logical pipeline

Now I would want you to think about it like this:

```text
                MANUAL TRIGGER
                     │
                     ▼
            Select branch/environment
                     │
                     ▼
               Checkout code
                     │
                     ▼
              Setup Python
                     │
                     ▼
          Prepare Python environment
                     │
                     ▼
           Install dependencies
                     │
                     ▼
              Run tests*
                     │
                     ▼
             Deploy to EC2
                     │
                     ▼
          Restart via Supervisor
                     │
                     ▼
          Check Supervisor status
                     │
                     ▼
             HTTP Health Check
                │          │
               PASS       FAIL
                │          │
                ▼          ▼
             SUCCESS     FAILURE
```

`*` Tests only when tests actually exist.

